# Mood Palette - A Visual Mood Tracker & Color Journal

## Concept
"Mood Palette" is a unique, visually engaging daily mood tracker that lets users log their emotions by selecting from a palette of professional colors. Each day, users pick a color that best represents their mood and add an optional note. Over time, the app displays a beautiful calendar grid of colored tiles—creating a personal 'mood palette' journal.

This approach combines color psychology with journaling in an innovative way, offering both emotional insight and aesthetic satisfaction. It's ideal for anyone interested in self-reflection or mental wellness.

---

## Features

- **Modern UI:** Uses professional colors (muted pastels and deep tones), rounded frames, and clean fonts.
- **Daily Logging:** Select your mood color from a curated palette; add an optional text note.
- **Calendar View:** See your month as colored tiles—a visual diary of your moods.
- **Notes Popup:** Click any tile to view or edit the day's note.
- **Data Persistence:** Saves data locally (using JSON) so you never lose your history.

